# Assess QFP tube condition before use: use count (preference)

Standing user preference: Assess QFP tube condition before use: use count ≤4 is clean and usable; use count = 5 requires cleaning before next use; cracked or otherwise damaged tubes must be quarantined and not used.

## Conventions
- Assess QFP tube condition before use: use count ≤4 is clean and usable; use count = 5 requires cleaning before next use; cracked or otherwise damaged tubes must be quarantined and not used.

